# Never track the CLI config -- it holds MySubaru credentials (user/pass/PIN).
# Listed after the whitelist entries so it wins even inside included dirs
# (e.g. the git-ignored dev config bind-mounted under .devcontainer/).
**/subarulink.cfg
**/.subarulink.cfg
/.devcontainer/subarulink-config/

